loating window, and selecting a GridMap node again won't make the dock floating and bring it back to its previous position/size automatically. This should be addressed in a future PR, as this also affects other closable docks. (I've only noticed it now, as working with GridMaps tends to require switching around the selected node a fair bit.)","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113396#pullrequestreview-3532447659","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113396","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113396#pullrequestreview-3532447659"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113396"}},"submitted_at":"2025-12-02T23:04:07Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3829289517,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7kPlIt","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/897172fa25699455f0a537f054654068b3dda5d5), it works as expected.\n\nMin